@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002

# COMPANIES — drizzle adapter

### Listar tudo
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies

### Paginação
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies?page=1&perPage=5

### Sem paginação
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies?paginate=false

# FILTROS

### Exato
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies?filter[name][eq]=Acme

### Like / ILike
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies?filter[name][ilike]=tech

### Comparação por data
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies?filter[createdAt][gte]=2024-01-01

### IN
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies?filter[name][in]=Acme,Globex,Initech

# ORDENAÇÃO

GET {{baseUrl}}/companies?sort=name

GET {{baseUrl}}/companies?sort=-createdAt

# CAMPOS

GET {{baseUrl}}/companies?fields=id,name

# INCLUDES — 1:N (users)
### Two-phase pagination ativa porque users é cardinality 'many'
### Resultado: rows como { company: {...}, users: [...] }
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies?includes=users&page=1&perPage=2

# COMBINAÇÕES

### Filter + include 1:N + paginação (two-phase + filter no root)
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies?filter[name][ilike]=acme&includes=users&page=1&perPage=5

# ERROS ESPERADOS

### ORDER BY em coluna da relação 'many' (users) → 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies?sort=-users.name
